    "updated_at": "2025-02-15T17:29:31Z",
    "body": "URLPattern seems to become the standard as it is right now. \n\n_From https://github.com/pillarjs/path-to-regexp/issues/349#issuecomment-2661004096_\n\n> I decided to adopt URLPattern now that it has become the standard for the web.\n> \n> * [Safari implemented URLPattern this week](https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=287391)\n> * [NodeJS implemented URLPattern this week](https://nodejs.org/api/url.html#class-urlpattern)\n> * [URLPattern got on the interop 2025 list this week](https://web.dev/blog/interop-2025?hl=en).\n\n",
